['Below is a C implementation for managing a dynamic list of `node` structures with concurrent access support using mutexes for thread safety. The function includes logging, configuration management, compression option, and memory usage statistics.

```c
#include <stdio.h>
#include <stdlib.h>
#include <string.h>
#include <pthread.h>
